Zainab Ki Sada Thi Mere Bhai Mere Abbas<br>
Tum Margaye Mai Ho Gaye Pardes Me Be-Aas<br>
<br>
Aada Ne Dagha-Bazi Se Kate Tere Shane<br>
Jo Guzri Hai Tuj Par Mere Bhayya Tuhi Jane<br>
Battiswa Ye Saal Tujhe Aaya Nahi Raas<br>
<br>
Shabbir Pe Kya Aalame Tanhayi Hai Chayi<br>
Ab Tere Alam Me Na Jiyega Mera Bhai<br>
Majaya Mera Hathon Ko Malta Hai Basat-Yas<br>
<br>
Dekho Mere Bhai Pe Ye Uftad Nayi Hai<br>
Yun Lagta Hai Jaise Ke Kamar Toot Gayi Hai<br>
Darya Ki Taraf Dekhte Hai Shah Basat-Yas<br>
<br>
Qabza Kiya Darya Pa Magar Tu Raha Pyasa<br>
Har Lamha Huwa Pyas Ki Shiddat Me Izaafa<br>
Har Aan Nigahon Me Sakina Ki Rahi Pyas<br>
<br>
Ab Kaun Yaha Pouchne Wala Hai Hamara<br>
Ghar Loot Gaya Baqi Na-raha Koi Sahara<br>
Marne Se Tere Ahle Haram Hogaye Be-Aas<br>
<br>
Ab Tum Jo Nahi Ho Meri Chin Jayegi Chadar<br>
Jane Hi Padega Mujhe Balwe Me Khule Sar<br>
Zainab Ko Teri Aati Reh-Reh Ke Ye Was-Waas<br>
<br>
Pani Na Raha Qaima-e-Shabbir Me Jis Dam<br>
Har Ek Ke Hotoun Pe Tera Naam Tha Paiham<br>
Reh Reh Ke Sadaye Tujhe Deti Thi Har Ek Pyas<br>
<br>
Dekho Mera Kya Haal Kiya Ahlef-Jafa Ne<br>
Kya Dekh Sakege Mere Jakde Huwe Shane<br>
Har Lamha Aisiri Ka Badh Jata Hai Ahsas<br>
<br>
Bechain Hai Pani Liye Shaha Ki Dukhtar<br>
Nannisi Zuba Munhse Nikal Ayi Hai Bahar<br>
Main Kaise Bujaoungi Sakina Ki Bhala Pyas<br>
<br>
Har Simt Tera Gham Tere Matam Ki Sada Hai<br>
Moula Tera Ahsan Ki Faqat Ek Dua Hai<br>
Bas Aakhri Sasoun Me Rahe Tu Bhi Mere Paas